      "side": 1,
      "message": "So I think instead of passing all this stuff in here separately, we should pass in a DawnTextureInfo struct. This can then directly initialize the fInfo on the BackendTexture. Metal is a little unique in that we don\u0027t pass in a MtlTextureInfo directly, but that is only because in Metal you can query all the properties directly off the MtlTextureInfo",
